  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x0" flags="0x0">
    <title>Switch to enable intercooler pressure drop compensation</title>
    <description>S_PLDSOLL_LLKNDK - Setting to 1 allows a factor to increase to Boost Target accounting for integrated charge air cooler losses. Set to 0 if you want Boost Target to follow our 3D Boost Ceiling exactly.</description>
