  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x0" flags="0x0">
    <title>VMAX array (new in 90V9027AFB)</title>
    <description>XDF_VMAX_array - not in the 90V90269AB A2L. Five 16-bit km/h values (308 on stock M5) in a block that was empty in 90V90269AB; the old LLim_vMaxSpdTyp* block was removed in this version. Identified by comparison, unverified.</description>
